{
  "$comment": "Copyright 2026 The Senseplane Authors. SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0. The known sensor senses (ADR 0060). `kind` is number (a value in `unit`), state (on/off: `on` is what true means, `off` what false means) or event (something happened, with an optional detail). A reading of a sense not listed here is accepted with the kind it states and, for numbers, any unit token. `name` is what people read; `words` are what the rule-based watch compiler matches; `symbol` is how a unit is shown. Generated copies: api/src/generated/senses.json, mcp/src/generated/senses.json, console/src/generated/senses.json (pnpm codegen).",
  "units": {
    "celsius": "°C",
    "percent": "%",
